Your turn. Say it with me. The separation of powers protects civil liberties.

15
00:01:47.979 --> 00:02:04.242
Constitutional law governs the separation of powers and protects civil liberties through due process. Judicial review allows courts to examine legislation against legal precedent, while an amendment can formally update the constitution itself.

16
